    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0142" n="54" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg54"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Wharton.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic">June 23,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan, in view of the strong desire expressed to him by the minister for
                    foreign affairs for a prompt and friendly settlement of the claims growing out
                    of the <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi> incident to be made with the
                    minister of the United States, asks that particulars be sent to him at the
                    earliest date practicable.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
